{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"For this to work, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"type":"text","text":" must include “twint-extended”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"If you configure any ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxIssuerNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Additionally, if the fetch fails and the cache is empty, none of these apps will be found when probing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/adyenactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct\/twint-swift.struct\/maxissuernumber"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"role":"symbol","title":"maxIssuerNumber","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:5Adyen0A15ActionComponentC13ConfigurationV5TwintV15maxIssuerNumberSivp"},"identifier"